  <descriptions>
    <description xml:lang="en" descriptionType="SeriesInformation">The EUROSTUDENT Working Paper Series offers a platform for researchers to share early-stage work analyzing data collected through EUROSTUDENT student surveys. These surveys gather comparable data on the social and economic conditions of student life across 25+ European countries. The series aims to enhance the understanding of student life and higher education systems within the European Higher Education Area (EHEA).</description>
